        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1456414952347_918609_43113" xmi:uuid="4c08dfe6-ab28-4356-acef-439bd8cfd403" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193659_336717_26742"/>
          <body> the status of the evaluation. One of the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'invalid': the evaluation is not valid; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'not evaluatable': the evaluation cannot be concluded; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'to be evaluated': the evaluation is still to be performed; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'valid': the evaluation is valid.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>EvaluationStatus</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
