        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193147_187035_23662"/>
        <body>A MeasuredCharacteristic contains the result of measurement activity that is a set of properties resulting from an inspection of product data. &lt;note&gt; For consistency purpose between PropertyValues, the related PropertyDefinitions that are used in MeasuredCharacteristic may be the same as the ones used in PlannedCharacteristic.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
