        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1456415237361_196050_43126" xmi:uuid="f50cb1c9-d396-4fb4-938b-9835c0a581fc" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193908_675934_28210"/>
          <body> the design intent information of the PlannedCharacteristic in terms of PropertyValue objects. &lt;note&gt; For multiple measurements representing one or multiple requirements, use the ValueSet or ValueList.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
